#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:324
msgid ""
"Carriers limit how large a multimedia message can be. Images and videos you "
"attach are automatically compressed to fit under this limit before sending.\n"
"\n"
"600 kB is a safe default for most carriers. Pick a smaller value if your "
"messages fail to send, or a larger one if you know your carrier allows it."
msgstr ""
"Cov tuam txhab xov tooj txwv qhov loj ntawm cov lus multimedia. Cov duab "
"thiab yeeb yaj kiab uas koj ntxig yuav raug nyem kom me tsis siv neeg kom "
"poob qab qhov txwv no ua ntej xa.\n"
"\n"
"600 kB yog tus nqi pib uas nyab xeeb rau feem ntau cov tuam txhab xov tooj. "
"Xaiv tus nqi me dua yog tias koj cov lus xa tsis tau, lossis tus loj dua yog "
"tias koj paub tias koj lub tuam txhab tso cai."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:352
msgid ""
"Merging calls into a conference is up to the carrier, and in our testing the "
"results varied from working to dropping the calls. Turn this on to try it on "
"your own subscription. It cannot be officially supported, so leave it off if "
"you would rather your calls behaved predictably."
msgstr "Kev muab cov xov tooj ua ke mus ua xov tooj ua pawg nyob ntawm lub tuam txhab xov tooj, thiab hauv peb kev sim cov txiaj ntsig txawv txav ntawm kev ua tau zoo mus txog kev txiav cov xov tooj. Qhib qhov no kom sim nyob hauv koj tus kheej txoj kab. Tsis tuaj yeem muab kev txhawb nqa raws cai, yog li cia nws kaw yog tias koj xav kom koj cov xov tooj ua raws li koj xav."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:360
msgid ""
"Transferring two calls to each other needs a service the carrier has to "
"provide, and in our testing many carriers either refuse it or end the calls "
"instead. Turn this on to try it on your own subscription. It cannot be "
"officially supported, so leave it off if you would rather your calls behaved "
"predictably."
msgstr "Kev txuas ob tug xov tooj rau ib leeg xav tau ib qho kev pabcuam uas lub tuam txhab xov tooj yuav tsum muab, thiab hauv peb kev sim ntau lub tuam txhab tsis kam lossis txiav cov xov tooj. Qhib qhov no kom sim nyob hauv koj tus kheej txoj kab. Tsis tuaj yeem muab kev txhawb nqa raws cai, yog li cia nws kaw yog tias koj xav kom koj cov xov tooj ua raws li koj xav."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:371
msgid ""
"When the modem stops responding, the phone quietly restarts the modem stack "
"by itself and you only hear about it if that fails. The phone is never "
"rebooted automatically. When this is off, the Modem Recovery screen appears "
"instead so you can run the restart yourself."
msgstr "Thaum lub modem tsis teb lawm, lub xov tooj nws tus kheej pib dua lub modem software ntsiag to, thiab koj hnov txog nws xwb yog tias qhov ntawd ua tsis tiav. Lub xov tooj tsis txeev pib dua nws tus kheej li. Thaum qhov no kaw, lub vijtsam Rov Qab Muab Modem tshwm los es koj tus kheej pib dua."

