#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:158
msgid ""
"Contacts can trigger an action by sending a secret SMS message. Add contacts "
"below and set their secret trigger phrase."
msgstr ""
"Cov neeg sib cuag tuaj yeem ua rau muaj kev cuam tshuam los ntawm kev xa cov "
"lus zais SMS. Ntxiv cov neeg hauv qab no thiab teeb tsa lawv cov kab lus "
"zais cia."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:161
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can request your location by sending a secret SMS message. "
"TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and set their "
"secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Cov neeg uas ntseeg siab tuaj yeem thov koj qhov chaw nyob los ntawm kev xa "
"cov lus zais SMS. TOTP yog qhov yuav tsum tau ua rau qhov no ua haujlwm. "
"Ntxiv cov neeg hauv qab no thiab teeb tsa lawv cov kab lus zais cia. Piv "
"txwv template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:164
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can silently trigger a callback by sending a secret SMS "
"message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and "
"set their secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Cov neeg uas ntseeg siab tuaj yeem ua ntsiag to ua rau hu rov qab los ntawm "
"kev xa cov lus zais SMS. TOTP yog qhov yuav tsum tau ua rau qhov no ua "
"haujlwm. Ntxiv cov neeg hauv qab no thiab teeb tsa lawv cov kab lus zais "
"cia. Piv txwv template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:167
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can send an SMS relay. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Real life example: 'Gorilla "
"123456 +1234567890 Hello'"
msgstr ""
"Cov neeg uas ntseeg siab tuaj yeem xa SMS xa mus. TOTP yog qhov yuav tsum "
"tau ua rau qhov no ua haujlwm. Ntxiv cov neeg hauv qab no thiab teeb tsa "
"lawv cov kab lus zais cia. Piv txwv template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 "
"MESSAGE' Lub neej tiag tiag piv txwv: 'Gorilla 123456 +1234567890 Nyob zoo'"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:170
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can start a tmate SSH session and receive the SSH access "
"string by sending a secret SMS message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Cov neeg uas ntseeg siab tuaj yeem pib tmate SSH kev sib ntsib thiab tau "
"txais SSH txoj hlua nkag los ntawm kev xa cov lus zais SMS. TOTP yog qhov "
"yuav tsum tau ua rau qhov no ua haujlwm. Ntxiv cov neeg hauv qab no thiab "
"teeb tsa lawv cov kab lus zais cia. Piv txwv template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real "
"life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:173
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can lock your device: the SIM PIN is changed to a new one "
"and locked, and the phone powers off. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to "
"work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"
msgstr ""
"Cov neeg uas ntseeg siab tuaj yeem xauv koj lub cuab yeej: tus PIN ntawm SIM "
"raug hloov mus rau ib tug tshiab thiab raug xauv, thiab lub xov tooj kaw. "
"TOTP yog qhov yuav tsum tau ua rau qhov no ua haujlwm. Ntxiv cov neeg hauv "
"qab no thiab teeb tsa lawv cov kab lus zais cia. Piv txwv template: 'SECRET "
"TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Lub neej tiag tiag piv txwv: "
"'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"

